## Executive summary

Enterprises that treat AI governance as a one-off policy document underperform peers that treat it as an operating model with owners, forums, and living inventories.

## What good looks like

- A model and system inventory with named owners
- Risk tiers tied to approval paths
- Evaluation standards for high-impact use cases
- Clear build/buy/partner decision criteria

